The MIT license above covers the R code (run_all.R, R/, run.sh). The data files
under data/ and the tables and figures under output/ are released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/): reuse them with attribution to
the paper and this repository. Files whose values originate with a third party
keep their source's terms: the Chessie B-IBI scores are outputs of the
Interstate Commission on the Potomac River Basin's scoring workflow (Smith et
al. 2017) run on the author's collections, and the trait affinities derive from
the CONUS trait database of Twardochleb et al. (2021).
